{"full":"hf:sensenova/sensenova-u1-infographic-v3","spaceId":"sensenova/sensenova-u1-infographic-v3","name":"SenseNova U1 Infographic V3","source":"huggingface","description":"Infographic generation & editing with SenseNova-U1 V3","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["gradio","mcp-server","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":18,"created":"2026-07-16T15:22:33.000Z","updated":"2026-07-18T19:22:38.000Z","license":null,"runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://sensenova-sensenova-u1-infographic-v3.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/sensenova/sensenova-u1-infographic-v3","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:38:23.977Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T23:38:23.977Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T23:38:23.977Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"📊","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Unified infographic generation and editing with sensenova/SenseNova-U1-8B-MoT-Infographic-V3, running on ZeroGPU.","SenseNova-U1-8B-MoT-Infographic-V3 is a monolithic any-to-any (NEO-Unify) model that unifies multimodal understanding, generation, and editing in one architecture (no separate visual encoder / VAE). It renders complex, text-dense infographics (charts, posters, knowledge illustrations) across English and Chinese, and — new in V3 — edits existing images via natural-language instructions: local text edits, content insert / remove / replace, global style changes, and layout tweaks.","Generation and editing use the model's officially recommended settings: cfgscale=4.0, imgcfgscale=1.0, cfgnorm=\"none\", timestepshift=3.0, numsteps=50."],"features":["Generate — text → infographic (t2igenerate).","Edit — image + instruction → edited image (it2igenerate)."],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/sensenova/sensenova-u1-infographic-v3/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9360f88272ade906013cf7ce088c7802b7436d59cd1a6596795a90568baeb11f","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T17:53:08.544Z"},"overviewCheckedAt